<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 11.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 11.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Friday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali chairs a cabinet meeting which was informed on the Stock Exchange modernisation.</p>
<p>- President Ali recommends a larger use of solar energy in public firms and schools.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Foreign Affairs Minister Habib Ben Yahia held talks on Wednesday in Lisbon with Portuguese officials on bilateral and Mediterranean cooperation.</p>
